[{"id":"CN-IP-005","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["路由","最长前缀匹配"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/"}],"articleIndex":5,"articleCount":17,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>多个路由都匹配目标 IP 时，通常如何选择？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>选择最长、最具体的匹配前缀。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>例如 /25 优先于 /24，/24 优先于默认 /0。真实设备还可能叠加管理距离、度量和策略路由。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>可以用一次路由查询把“最具体”变成证据：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">ip route get 198.51.100.140\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 重点看：出接口、源地址、下一跳\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>多条路由都匹配时先比较前缀长度，再按设备的管理距离、度量或策略路由规则继续判断；默认路由只是没有更具体匹配时的兜底。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-NET-001","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["分层","网络模型"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":18,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>学习网络分层时，为什么要同时看寻址、可达性和应用语义三条轴？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>寻址说明目标是谁，可达性说明数据能否沿路径交付，应用语义说明交付后请求是否按协议完成。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>三条轴回答的是三个不同问题：寻址解决“目标是谁、下一跳是谁”，可达性解决“数据能否沿路径到达”，应用语义解决“到达后请求是否被正确理解”。例如“页面打不开”可能卡在 DNS/IP、TCP/TLS，也可能已经收到 HTTP 响应却被 CORS 或业务规则拒绝。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>排障时先标记每条证据属于哪一轴，再决定下一步：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>轴\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>观察对象\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>不能直接推出\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>寻址\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>DNS 结果、目标 IP、路由和下一跳\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>应用请求一定成功\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>可达性\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>ARP/ND、TCP/TLS 握手和超时\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>HTTP 业务结果正确\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>应用语义\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>HTTP 状态、字段、CORS 和业务响应\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>更低层一定没有问题\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>这样可以避免把所有失败都叫作“网络不通”，也能说明下一条证据要验证哪一个假设。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-HTTP-002","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","请求","响应"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":16,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>HTTP 请求和响应各自的起始行、字段、内容边界如何阅读？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>请求起始行是方法/目标/版本，响应起始行是版本/状态码/短语；随后是字段，空行后可能有内容，内容长度和分帧还要看字段及协议版本。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>请求的起始行包含方法、目标和版本；响应的起始行包含版本、状态码和原因短语；两者后面都是字段，空行只表示字段区结束。空行之后是否还有多少内容，要继续看 \u003ccode>Content-Length\u003c/code>、分块传输、连接关闭或 HTTP/2/3 的帧结束标记。\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight http\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">POST\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">/items\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"meta\">HTTP/1.1\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"attribute\">Host\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"punctuation\">: \u003c/span>example.test\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"attribute\">Content-Length\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"punctuation\">: \u003c/span>13\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"language-css\">&#123;&quot;name&quot;:\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;A&quot;\u003c/span>&#125;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"language-css\">\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"language-css\">HTTP/\u003cspan class=\"number\">1.1\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">201\u003c/span> Created\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"language-css\">\u003cspan class=\"attribute\">Content\u003c/span>-Length: \u003cspan class=\"number\">10\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"language-css\">\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"language-css\">&#123;&quot;id&quot;: \u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span>&#125;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>HTTP/2/3 不再使用 HTTP/1.1 的文本线格式，但仍能映射出方法、状态、字段和内容边界。看到一个空行不能直接把后续字节当成完整响应，也不能仅凭起始行判断业务处理成功。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-HTTP-FAQ-005","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","401","403","认证"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/"}],"articleIndex":16,"articleCount":16,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>401 和 403 的区别是不是“未登录”和“没权限”？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>这是常见但不完整的简化：401 关注认证凭据缺失或无效，403 表示服务器理解请求但拒绝授权。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>通常可以这样记：\u003ccode>401 Unauthorized\u003c/code> 表示没有提供有效身份凭证，或凭证已过期/错误，客户端往往需要重新登录；\u003ccode>403 Forbidden\u003c/code> 表示服务端已经识别请求者，但权限策略拒绝这次操作。\u003ccode>401\u003c/code> 常伴随 \u003ccode>WWW-Authenticate\u003c/code>，但最终响应仍以 API 契约为准。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>实际系统还可能用 \u003ccode>404\u003c/code> 隐藏资源是否存在，避免被枚举。复现时结合认证字段、资源所有权、响应头和 API 契约判断；收到这三个状态都说明至少有 HTTP 响应可观察，却不能只用“未登录/没权限”两句口诀覆盖所有策略。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-MOD-FAQ-003","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["SNI","证书","HTTPS"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/"}],"articleIndex":11,"articleCount":13,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>有了 SNI，证书就一定正确吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不一定。SNI 只提示服务端选择哪个虚拟主机，客户端仍需验证证书链、SAN 主机名、有效期、用途和本地策略。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>SNI (Server Name Indication) 只是客户端在 TLS 握手中告诉服务端“想访问哪个主机”，帮助服务端选择证书和虚拟主机；它不是证书校验本身。即使 SNI 正确，客户端仍要检查证书链是否可信、SAN (Subject Alternative Name) 是否匹配目标主机、有效期/用途和本地信任库，否则连接仍应失败。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>检查\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>回答的问题\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>SNI\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>服务端选择哪个虚拟主机\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>证书链\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>证书是否由可信路径签发\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>SAN\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>证书是否覆盖目标主机名\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>有效期/用途\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>证书当前是否可用于该连接\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>排障时分别记录发送的 SNI、服务端返回的证书和客户端的验证错误，不能用“命中了正确虚拟主机”代替信任结论。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-dependency-override-cleanup","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["依赖覆盖","隔离"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十二)测试与质量保障.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十二)测试与质量保障","articlePath":"posts/d474d6f1/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十二)测试与质量保障.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十二)测试与质量保障","articlePath":"posts/d474d6f1/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>依赖覆盖为什么必须在每个测试后恢复？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>覆盖字典属于可变应用状态；不清理会让后续测试继续使用假身份、假配置或假数据库。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>在测试中设置 \u003ccode>app.dependency_overrides[original] = replacement\u003c/code> 后，任何使用同一 app 的请求都会看到替代依赖。用 \u003ccode>try/finally\u003c/code> 或 fixture teardown 清空，并可断言字典为空。清理不仅防止顺序依赖，也能保证失败测试不会留下安全策略或数据库连接的假状态。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-03-upsert-stock-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["UPSERT","库存","幂等"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(三)数据写入与约束.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(三)数据写入与约束","articlePath":"posts/4df9aab4/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(三)数据写入与约束.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(三)数据写入与约束","articlePath":"posts/4df9aab4/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>库存表中 \u003ccode>product_id=101\u003c/code> 已有 20 件，现在导入 5 件；不存在时插入 5，存在时增加 5，SQL 怎么写？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>INSERT INTO inventory (product_id, quantity) VALUES (101, 5) AS incoming ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE quantity = inventory.quantity + incoming.quantity;\u003c/code>\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE\u003c/code> 只有在唯一键冲突时才进入更新分支，因此 \u003ccode>product_id\u003c/code> 必须是主键或唯一键。把两种业务语义并排看更不容易写错：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>题意\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>更新表达式\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>原值 20、输入 5 的结果\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>增加入库量\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>quantity = inventory.quantity + incoming.quantity\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>25\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>覆盖库存\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>quantity = incoming.quantity\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>5\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>先确认唯一键和目标语义，再用 \u003ccode>SELECT\u003c/code> 回读结果；不能因为语句返回成功就推断库存一定按预期变化。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-pytest-markers","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["pytest","标记"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(八)测试框架设计.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(八)测试框架设计","articlePath":"posts/c92e7868/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(八)测试框架设计.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(八)测试框架设计","articlePath":"posts/c92e7868/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>已知某个能力只在 Chromium 中受支持，怎样表达浏览器范围？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>B\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>浏览器不支持属于运行矩阵边界，应使用插件提供的浏览器选择标记；\u003ccode>xfail\u003c/code> 只表示有明确记录的预期缺陷，不能把环境差异伪装成产品失败。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>浏览器能力差异应该进入运行矩阵，而不是被异常吞掉：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@pytest.mark.only_browser(\u003cspan class=\"params\">\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;chromium&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">test_feature\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">page\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    ...\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>矩阵标记让“未在此浏览器执行”可追踪；xfail 代表有记录的预期缺陷，不能把环境不支持伪装成产品没有问题。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["B"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>在测试体内捕获所有异常\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>使用 \u003ccode>only_browser(&quot;chromium&quot;)\u003c/code> 或等价的浏览器矩阵标记\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>把用例永久标记为 \u003ccode>xfail\u003c/code>\u003c/p>\n"}]},{"id":"pytest-nodeid","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["收集"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(三)测试收集与运行控制.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(三)测试收集与运行控制","articlePath":"posts/b5dda780/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(三)测试收集与运行控制.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(三)测试收集与运行控制","articlePath":"posts/b5dda780/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Node ID 如何组成，为什么适合精确复跑？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它由文件、类、函数和参数 ID 组成，能把一次筛选缩小到单个可收集节点。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Node ID 是收集树中的路径，例如 \u003ccode>tests/test_discount.py::test_total[vip-20]\u003c/code>：文件、类、测试函数和参数化 ID 逐层连接。它不是手写标签，应该先从收集结果复制：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">python -m pytest --collect-only -q\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">python -m pytest -q \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;tests/test_discount.py::test_total[vip-20]&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>方括号里的参数 ID 让一次数据集可以单独复跑；如果 ID 不稳定或包含难以转义的内容，失败报告就难以复现，应显式给 \u003ccode>ids\u003c/code> 或 \u003ccode>pytest.param(..., id=...)\u003c/code>。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-allure-hidden-secret","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["报告安全"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十一)覆盖率与测试报告.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十一)覆盖率与测试报告","articlePath":"posts/51d93cec/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十一)覆盖率与测试报告.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十一)覆盖率与测试报告","articlePath":"posts/51d93cec/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Allure 的 HIDDEN/MASKED 参数为什么仍可能泄密？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它们可能只改变页面展示，原始值仍保存在结果文件、附件或日志中。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>展示层的隐藏不等于删除原始数据。敏感值可能同时出现在参数、步骤上下文、附件、JUnit 属性和终端日志中，因此脱敏应发生在采集点：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">safe_headers\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">headers: \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">dict\u003c/span>[\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">str\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">str\u003c/span>]\u003c/span>) -&gt; \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">dict\u003c/span>[\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">str\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">str\u003c/span>]:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> &#123;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        key: (\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;***&quot;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">if\u003c/span> key.lower() \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">in\u003c/span> &#123;\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;authorization&quot;\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;cookie&quot;\u003c/span>&#125; \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">else\u003c/span> value)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">for\u003c/span> key, value \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">in\u003c/span> headers.items()\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    &#125;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>上传前搜索所有报告目录和日志，确认没有原始令牌、完整请求体或个人数据；\u003ccode>HIDDEN\u003c/code>/\u003ccode>MASKED\u003c/code> 只能改变展示，不能替代撤销已泄露凭据和收紧访问权限。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]